Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}(ｷｬｯｼｰ/鉄男)徳之助！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯茜/铁男)德之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}(等々力)徳之助君！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)德之助君！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}あなたにも人柱となっていただきましょう！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连你也就请你成为人柱吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}ｱﾃﾞｭｰ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Adieu！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}徳之助！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.39,0:09:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}いや～！ 徳之助く～ん！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要啊～！德之助～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}ご安心なさい｡ どうせ\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请放心。反正
